WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Select the earlier record
Two illustrative AIO records. Start with a bounded read.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pin it as the baseline
Open Compare and pin the record before selecting another.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Select the later record
Before stays pinned. Your next selection becomes After.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Compare interpreted values
Protected projection keeps the inspector’s interpretation and masking.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check ordered headers
Matching payloads would not prove matching headers.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep the conclusion precise
A field difference does not establish downstream processing success.
